            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.4+ACT.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:4–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.9+ACT.26.10+ACT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:9–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnamanya maisha gangu vyokala nriphokala nalunga dini na mila za Chiyahudi. Nágayisa afuasi a Jesu bila ya mbazi tse, na nchitaka kuaangamiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 22:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nálunga dini ya Chiyahudi vinono hata kushinda marika gangu, tsona nchidzilavya sana kulunga mila za akare angu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.9.3+ACT.9.4+ACT.9.5+ACT.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 9:3–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.6+ACT.22.7+ACT.22.8+ACT.22.9+ACT.22.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:6–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.13+ACT.26.14+ACT.26.15+ACT.26.16+ACT.26.17+ACT.26.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:13–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Mlungu kala analonda chivyanjina. Wanitenga hata kabila sidzangbwevyalwa, na achinitsambula kulengana na arivyomendza iye ili nimhumikire, hata dzagbwe kala sifwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatiwe ariopanga uriphofika, Mlungu wanionyesa mwanawe, ili nitangazire atu asio kala Ayahudi habari nono kuhusu mwanawe Jesu. Na wakati hinyo siyaendza ushauri kula kpwa mutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala siyaphiya Jerusalemu kpwa hara ambao kala ni mitume kare, ela mara mwenga náphiya weru wa Warabuni, chisha badaye ndipho nchiuya Damasikasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
